The T-matrix method of Michael Mishchenko, NASA Goddard Institute for Space
Studies, New York, funded by the NASA Radiation Sciences Program.

ARTS's T-matrix solver (src/core/tmatrix) is a C++ port of his
double-precision Fortran programs and is covered by their licence.

See License.txt or http://www.giss.nasa.gov/staff/mmishchenko/t_matrix.html
for details.

Files included in this directory:

License.txt        # The licence of the original programs, which ARTS registers
                   # for ENABLE_TMATRIX builds
tmatrix_ampld.ref  # Printed outputs of the original programs: fixed orientation
tmatrix_amplq.ref  # (ampld, double precision; amplq, extended precision) and
tmatrix_tmd.ref    # random orientation (tmd, double precision; tmq, extended
tmatrix_tmq.ref    # precision).  tmatrix-reference-test and
                   # tests/core/tmatrix/reference.tmatrix.py compare with them.
